# Managed by ansible — see roles/nut_ups.
# upsd (NUT data server) config.
#
# LOOPBACK-ONLY on purpose (v1): nothing outside this host needs upsd
# yet, and keeping it off the LAN means zero new open ports and zero
# cluster-firewall changes. Remote monitoring from the other two pve
# nodes is a documented extension (README.md) that would switch this to
# LISTEN 192.168.86.11 3493 + ALLOW 127.0.0.1 192.168.86.0/24 AND add an
# IN ACCEPT for tcp/3493 sourced from +pve_nodes in the cluster
# firewall — do not enable one without the other.
LISTEN 127.0.0.1 3493
ALLOW 127.0.0.1
